{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id39918785"}, "name":{"label":"amelialeason"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2015-04-07T21:10:46-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.0.3"}, "id":{"label":"1179562001"}, "title":{"label":"Almost perfect"}, "content":{"label":"Gorgeous interface. Especially in comparison to the other ambient noise apps on offer. Simple. Easy to use. Though, I will admit I was a bit confused when trying to set the timer. It was not immediately obvious to me that you had to swipe up/down to increase/decrease time since there was no visual cue that it worked that way. \n\nI, too, would love to see integration with iOS more so I can control it from my lock screen, like Rain, Rain does. \n\nMore noise options would be great. Again, Rain, Rain offers quite a number of ambient noises to choose from. \n\nBut, it's the simple, colorful, clean design of this app that makes this my favorite. Keep up the good work.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=862773459&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
