{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id117882102"}, "name":{"label":"Campvest"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2015-02-24T12:19:01-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.0.3"}, "id":{"label":"1157769719"}, "title":{"label":"Awesome"}, "content":{"label":"Great app. Let's you play multiple sounds at once and adjust the volume independently for each. Total life saver. Annoying guy in the library chewing? Listen to a rolling river. Dad snoring so loud you can't sleep? Try some thunder storms. Lady sits right next to you at a coffee shop and starts laughing inappropriately loud? How about some ambient bird sounds. Seriously. Get this app.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=862773459&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id210549399"}, "name":{"label":"thematrix525"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2015-02-24T09:03:32-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.0.3"}, "id":{"label":"1157680807"}, "title":{"label":"It could be better."}, "content":{"label":"I like the simplicity of user interface of the app. I use this app on a daily basis. I use the white noise sound(s) to put my 6 month old baby to sleep. It works great, except for one issue that I have been having. I think it might be a looping issue or something. But basically when I use the app for a long period of time (sometimes for an hour) to put my baby to sleep. The white noise would skip or the looping of the sound isn't in sync or something. It basically makes a skipping noise and continues playing. This is a problem for me because as my baby falls asleep that skipping noise sometimes wakes him up.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=862773459&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id32195854"}, "name":{"label":"Q4242"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2015-02-22T13:31:38-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.0.3"}, "id":{"label":"1156404777"}, "title":{"label":"It's ok."}, "content":{"label":"I wouldn't have been happy if I'd payed for this app, but luckily it's a freebie from Starbucks. There are obvious compression artifacts in some of the higher pitched sounds. The sound that I think is supposed to be the ocean isn't very good. But overall the app is ok.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=862773459&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id39936370"}, "name":{"label":"Starfia"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2015-02-21T10:35:36-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.0.3"}, "id":{"label":"1155525162"}, "title":{"label":"Good option for customizable ambient noise."}, "content":{"label":"Noisli provides an array of 16 decent-quality audio samples of nature, generated noise, and a couple of other choices to suit specific tastes (including a travelling train, a traditional electric fan, a coffee shop, and a fireplace).\n\nThe good: multiple sounds can be activated at once and individually balanced.  (A little wind with your gentle stream?)  Once that's done, you can switch apps and let that carry on.  If you don't, the clean interface phases gently between hues.  Customizations can be saved and recalled.\n\nA couple of complaints: no landscape mode – an inconvenience for those who use an iPhone or iPad stand.  More than once, I've had a second volume slider appear (at a different displayed level) directly on top of the already visible one.  In short, the interface isn't polished to a shine.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=862773459&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id42150265"}, "name":{"label":"mdn323"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2015-02-21T00:28:26-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.0.3"}, "id":{"label":"1155147212"}, "title":{"label":"Nice app but buggy"}, "content":{"label":"For a simple app it is slightly buggy. When I play my existing prerecorded combo I get multiple dots on the volume lines. Some sounds are not being played but the volume dots for these are on the farthest left regardless so I get confused as to which sounds are actually playing. \n\nPlease update it to:\n1) Have landscape orientation on iPad\n2) Ability to edit existing prerecorded combo sounds\n3) Make user interface a little less mysterious", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=862773459&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id438068665"}, "name":{"label":"SubaruMel"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2015-02-20T11:29:11-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.0.3"}, "id":{"label":"1154777261"}, "title":{"label":"Great for relaxation"}, "content":{"label":"Thank you to Starbucks for making the app of the week otherwise I never would have known about it! Realistic sounds that you can mix & match & at different volumes is fantastic as you can tailor it to the mood that you want. It assists in relaxation, also for when you need to concentrate. I am using it in my natural therapy clinic to create the right ambiance.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=862773459&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
