{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id26280499"}, "name":{"label":"The Carpenter 2"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2015-02-18T02:20:34-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.0.3"}, "id":{"label":"1152382108"}, "title":{"label":"Very Nice"}, "content":{"label":"I like the wide selection of sounds with an intuitive UI. The combo saving feature is very cool! However, would it be possible to add the ability to play sounds from this app simultaneously with music from the music app or another third-party audio playing app?", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=862773459&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id35801400"}, "name":{"label":"Roadtripped_Out"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2015-02-17T16:44:25-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.0.3"}, "id":{"label":"1152002379"}, "title":{"label":"Not too shabby but not great either"}, "content":{"label":"The good: \n- you can mix and match sounds like wind+thunderstorms or wind+rain+forest\n- cute and colorful simple UI. Really like the fact that the colours change\n\nThe bad:\n- The app is pretty huge. If the option to expand sounds come about, might be good to have it as a downloadable thing so if I don't want water sounds I don't have to DL them. This would keep app size smaller\n- UX is a bit buggy on first launch. Had to swipe up to make the right swipe work, then R/L swiping worked as expected.\n- can't turn off some of the sounds. Supposed to be able to click to turn off but wind+thunderstorm combo disallows this. \n\nThat being said, I would love to have a cat purring sound... :) (and fixing the above bugs)", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=862773459&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
